Built-Using: ${misc:Built-Using}
Description: command-line client for the EyalSec API
 eyalsec-cli reads your EyalSec security events and machines from a
 terminal, a cron job or a CI step. It lists and searches events, shows one
 event's full detail, exports matching events as CSV or JSON, and lists
 machines and runs, through the EyalSec API. A read-only API key is enough.
